WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.079 --> 00:00:07.717
Ally tossed and turned all night long, convinced that Dr. Lloyd knew her secret.

2
00:00:07.718 --> 00:00:12.556
Even worse, he was going to reveal it to the whole world tomorrow at the sci-fi convention.

3
00:00:12.557 --> 00:00:23.161
Everyone would soon know that she was an alien from Astralia.

4
00:00:23.162 --> 00:00:30.203
"There is a 5 percent possibility that the billboard is not referring to you," the computer announced the next morning.

5
00:00:30.204 --> 00:00:35.099
"But Dr. Lloyd invited me to be his special guest!" Ally said.

6
00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:39.229
"Of course the billboard refers to me."

7
00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:43.829
"In that case, it would be illogical for you to go to the museum today."

8
00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:49.822
"But if I don't go, I'll never get the stuff we need!" Ally wailed.

9
00:00:49.823 --> 00:00:54.951
"In that case, it would be illogical for you not to go," Alpha said. "Ugh!"

10
00:00:54.952 --> 00:01:00.594
Ally said. "You're right. I have no choice." She

11
00:01:00.595 --> 00:01:04.614
put on her meld medallion and changed to her human form. "Here

12
00:01:04.615 --> 00:01:09.760
I go," she said as she headed for the door. "I'll see you later." The

13
00:01:09.761 --> 00:01:12.170
computer blinked but stayed silent. For

14
00:01:12.171 --> 00:01:17.845
once Alpha didn't seem to have anything to say. ***

15
00:01:17.846 --> 00:01:20.783
Ally was meeting the others at the diner.

16
00:01:20.784 --> 00:01:25.306
When she arrived, Flo was waiting on tables, and Ray was cooking in the kitchen.

17
00:01:25.307 --> 00:01:35.917
The tables were filled with customers. Almost everyone was wearing an alien costume.

18
00:01:35.918 --> 00:01:38.485
"Wow, you guys look terrific!"

19
00:01:38.486 --> 00:01:47.712
Ally said as Mateo and Bethany entered, wearing costumes too—the red uniforms of crew members from Cosmic Quest , a popular TV

20
00:01:47.713 --> 00:01:56.137
show. "Thanks!" Bethany said. "Is Kate here yet? She said she has a big surprise for

21
00:01:56.138 --> 00:02:04.279
us." "A surprise?" Ally gasped. "I forgot to tell Ray about the date that Kate and I

22
00:02:04.280 --> 00:02:07.269
arranged!" She turned to run into Ray's office, but it was too

23
00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:12.466
late. Kate and a woman wearing a fancy dress and high heels were walking into the

24
00:02:12.467 --> 00:02:19.688
diner. "Hello," the woman said. "I'm Kate's aunt Destiny. I'm here to see

25
00:02:19.689 --> 00:02:27.099
Ray." Mateo grinned. "Papi, you have a

26
00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:29.425
visitor!" Ray came into the dining

27
00:02:29.426 --> 00:02:35.266
room. "Can I help you?" he asked, wiping his hands on his apron, which was splattered with food

28
00:02:35.267 --> 00:02:39.938
stains. Aunt Destiny took one look at Ray and

29
00:02:39.939 --> 00:02:44.585
scowled. "I came all the way across town to meet him," she whispered loudly to

30
00:02:44.586 --> 00:02:49.645
Kate. "But he didn't even bother to wash up! Sorry, Kate, but I'm leaving!"

31
00:02:49.646 --> 00:02:57.599
Aunt Destiny marched out of the diner.

32
00:02:57.600 --> 00:03:10.596
Ray shook his head. "I have no idea what just happened, but I'm too busy for this crazy stuff," he said, heading back to the kitchen.

33
00:03:10.597 --> 00:03:15.613
Mateo looked from Ally to Kate. "What was that all about?"

34
00:03:15.614 --> 00:03:21.106
"That was all about making a mess of things," Kate mumbled.

35
00:03:21.107 --> 00:03:29.398
"It's my fault," Ally moaned. "I forgot to tell Ray that Kate and I invited her aunt here to meet him!"

36
00:03:29.399 --> 00:03:39.421
Flo overheard them. "Don't worry about it, girls. I'll cheer him up later with a few jokes I heard on TV last night."

37
00:03:39.422 --> 00:03:45.878
"Thanks for trying," Mateo said to Ally. "And Papi did enjoy playing golf yesterday."

38
00:03:45.879 --> 00:03:49.791
"That's good." Ally sighed.

39
00:03:49.792 --> 00:03:53.663
"Uh-oh! Look at the time!" Bethany said.

40
00:03:53.664 --> 00:03:57.882
"We have to get to the convention. Where's your costume, Ally?"

41
00:03:57.883 --> 00:04:03.761
"I have our costumes!" Kate pulled two pairs of pointy ears and antennae out of a bag.

42
00:04:03.762 --> 00:04:14.053
"We got them yesterday. And if anyone asks what we are, we're going to say we're cute aliens!"

43
00:04:14.054 --> 00:04:20.299
*** When Ally and her friends arrived at the museum, Phil quickly spotted them and waved them

44
00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:27.524
over. He let them in through a side

45
00:04:27.525 --> 00:04:30.596
door. "That was so nice of Phil," Mateo

46
00:04:30.597 --> 00:04:37.083
said. "He saved us a lot of time waiting in line. So where should we go

47
00:04:37.084 --> 00:04:40.644
first?" "I want to ride the space rocket

48
00:04:40.645 --> 00:04:45.864
simulator. I hear it makes you feel like you're flying in space," Bethany said.

49
00:04:45.865 --> 00:04:48.939
"Me too," Mateo and Kate agreed.

50
00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:53.187
Ally had no idea what they were talking about. But she had other things to do.

51
00:04:53.188 --> 00:04:59.130
"I, uh, don't like rides. I'll meet up with you guys later. Have fun!"

52
00:04:59.131 --> 00:05:02.755
She hurried off before they could say anything more.

53
00:05:02.756 --> 00:05:08.081
"That was easy!" Ally thought. "I hope getting my parts is just as easy."

54
00:05:08.082 --> 00:05:14.119
But when Ally arrived at Dr. Lloyd's exhibit hall, she realized that this task would be anything but easy.

55
00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:17.917
A guard stood at the metal detector at the entrance to the hall.

56
00:05:17.918 --> 00:05:21.705
"I can't go through that metal detector!" Ally thought.

57
00:05:21.706 --> 00:05:29.914
"The guard will make me take off my meld medallion. Ugh! What am I going to do now?"

